Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.14,0:02:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我年轻的时候  以为刷房子真就是刷房子\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}When I was young, I thought house painters painted houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我懂什么\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}What did I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我当时是个工人\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I was a working guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}南费城的卡车司机107号地方工会的工会代表\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}A business agent for Teamster Local 107 out of South Philly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.11,0:02:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}千百个工人中的一员\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}One of a thousand working stiffs...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}直到我不再是了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}until I wasn't no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.99,0:02:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}然后\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.21,0:02:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我开始刷房子\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I started painting houses...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}亲自\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs18\b0\bord0\shad0\pos(193,87)\fn方正大标宋简体\c&H13161A&}爱女婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs18\b0\bord0\shad0\fn方正大标宋简体\c&H13161A&\pos(198,133)}格蕾丝·安妮·{\fn方正粗宋简体\fs22\b0}巴法利诺
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs18\b0\bord0\shad0\fn方正大标宋简体\c&H13161A&\pos(191,185)}嫁给
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs18\b0\bord0\shad0\fn方正大标宋简体\c&H13161A&\pos(192,224)}罗伯特{\fn方正粗宋简体\fs22\b0}·里特
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.27,0:02:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}在这件事情上\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}In this particular matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}一切都是围绕着婚礼的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}the whole thing was built around the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:03:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}比尔·巴法利诺的女儿在底特律结婚\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Bill Bufalino's daughter was getting married in Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}比尔是卡车司机工会的律师  但更重要的是\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Bill was a Teamster lawyer, but more important,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.99,0:03:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他是罗素·巴法利诺的表亲\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}he was Russell Bufalino's cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.28,0:03:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}罗素不想坐飞机\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Now, Russell didn't want to fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.71,0:03:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}所以我打算开车送他去参加婚礼\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}so I was gonna drive him to the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.59,0:03:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他想顺路处理一些生意上的事情\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He wanted to take care of some business along the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}对罗素而言  这就意味着一件事\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}which in Russell's case meant only one thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}钱  收钱\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Money... collecting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}所以我们开车去的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}So we'd drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他和他老婆凯丽  以及我和我老婆艾琳\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Him and his wife Carrie and me and my wife Irene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我喊她琳妮\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Or I call her Reenie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.65,0:03:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我想着我们走费城外的476号公路\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I figured we would take 476 out of Philly,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.31,0:03:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}然后我们到匹兹顿接上罗素\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and then we go up to Pittston and pick up Russ,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我们一般都是这么走的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}which is usually how we did it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}然后沿80号州际公路西段开过宾州\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and then Interstate 80 West through the rest of Pennsylvania,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.57,0:03:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}然后我们横穿俄亥俄州到托莱多\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and then we'd go across Ohio, all the way to Toledo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.82,0:03:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}接着我们沿着75号公路北上底特律\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and then we would go 75 North to Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.33,0:03:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}总共要花三天\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It was gonna take about three days
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}算上所有谈生意以及抽烟的时间\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}with all the business breaks and cigarette stops,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:04:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}因为罗素不允许任何人在车里面抽烟\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}since Russell didn't allow nobody to smoke in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他说蓝眼睛吉米和迈尔·兰斯基\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He says Jimmy Blue Eyes and Meyer Lansky
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}说服他戒了烟\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}convinced him to stop smoking
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}当时他们从自己在古巴的赌场里被赶了出去\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}when they were getting kicked out of their casinos in Cuba
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}还被卡斯特罗开枪打了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and getting shot at by Castro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我也说不清楚  也许是那种\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I don't know. It might have been one of those,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}"上帝啊如果我活着度过这一劫\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}"Please-God-if-I-ever-get-out- of-this-fucking-thing-alive-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.23,0:04:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我就再也不抽烟了"的情况\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I'll-never-smoke-again things too."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.69,0:04:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}但我知道从卡斯特罗那件事开始\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}But I do know that from Castro on,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}罗素就再也不许别人在车里抽烟了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Russ wouldn't allow nobody to smoke in his car,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.61,0:04:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}就连凯丽也不行\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}not even Carrie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs46\b0\bord0\shad0\pos(192,240)\fn方正超粗黑简体}我听说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs46\b0\bord0\shad0\pos(192,240)\fn方正超粗黑简体}你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs46\b0\bord0\shad0\pos(192,240)\fn方正超粗黑简体}刷房子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.43,0:04:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}能尽快停车吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Can we stop soon?
