Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}凯丽  我发过誓的  记得吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Carrie, I made a vow. Remember?
