Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}行吧  这下我不能抽烟了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}All right, and now I can't smoke.
