Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.71,0:18:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}要是有人说他不怕可千万别信\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And don't let anybody tell you that they weren't afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-那纯属胡扯  知道吗  -是啊\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- That's a lot of bullshit. You know? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.43,0:18:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}人人都很害怕  而且会经常祈祷\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Everybody's afraid. And you pray a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.31,0:18:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我就经常祈祷\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I prayed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.93,0:18:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我祈祷说  要是能活着离开\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I prayed that I'd never sin again as long as I live
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.57,0:18:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我这辈子一定再也不沾染罪恶\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}if I could just get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}但紧接着战斗就开始了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}But then the fighting starts
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.98,0:18:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你就把一切都忘了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and then you forget about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:18:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你只想活下来  保住小命\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You're just trying to survive, stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}当我明白自己撑过了战争时\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Once I saw that I was getting through the war,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我看了看自己的周围  说...\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I looked around me, I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我说  "从现在起  一切顺其自然"\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I said, "From now on, whatever happens, happens."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.71,0:19:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}听天由命  去他的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Che successe successe. Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你懂的  你接到命令就得奉命行事\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You know, you got orders, you follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.63,0:19:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们让你带几个俘虏去树林里\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}They tell you to bring some prisoners into... into the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们并不会告诉你该怎么做\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}you know, and they don't tell you what to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.85,0:19:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们只说  "动作快点"\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}But they just say, you know, "Hurry up."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.19,0:19:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}说来疯狂  但我一直不能理解\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It's crazy, but I never understood
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们怎么会乖乖听话\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}how they would just keep digging
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}挖自己的坟墓\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}their own graves, you know. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}停\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.73,0:19:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}上来\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Raus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.37,0:19:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}可能他们觉得如果干得好\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Well, I mean, maybe they thought if they did a good job,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}那个拿枪的人\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}the guy with the gun
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.33,0:19:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}就会改变主意\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}would change his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}罗素  他立刻就对我有了好感\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Russell, he... he took a shine to me right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.86,0:20:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}不久之后\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}After a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他就开始给我分派些小任务了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}he started giving me little things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}不过那时候  安吉洛本人\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}But then Angelo himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.74,0:20:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}也开始交给我一些小任务了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}he started giving me little things to do too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}罗素的老婆  凯丽\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Russ's wife, Carrie,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.91,0:20:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}她的家族很久很久以前\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}her family goes all the way back, way, way back
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}在西西里岛跟巴法利诺家族是一个镇上的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}to the same town in Sicily as the Bufalinos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们总会谈论这事\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}They talked about it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.17,0:20:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}她来自黑帮中的皇室  可以这么说\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}She came from mob royalty, if you want to call it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}{\fn经典平黑简\fs14\b0\bord2\shad0.5\i1\pos(169.6,242.133)}希安德拉 {\i0}家族
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.64,0:20:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}希安德拉家族  对他们来说  就好像他们是早期\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}The Sciandras. To them, it was like they came over on the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.47,0:20:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}乘坐意大利{\u1}五月花号{\u0}来到美国的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}the Italian Mayflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.47,0:20:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}{\pos(192,245)\fs14\b0\bord1\shad0.5}五月花号是英国移民驶往北美的一艘最为著名的船只
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你上楼去吧  清洗一下\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Why don't you go upstairs, wash up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}衣服给我  我去处理\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Give me those clothes. I'll get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}别忘了脱鞋  罗素\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Don't forget your shoes, Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}弗兰克\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Hey, Frank,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}能尽快停车吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}can we stop soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.06,0:21:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}问问你老公吧  罗素\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Yeah, yeah, well, ask your husband. Russell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他都睡死了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He's out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.83,0:21:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}不用  我能行\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}No, no, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.08,0:21:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-能行吗  -行\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- Sure? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.76,0:22:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我们到哪了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.92,0:22:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}快到路易斯堡了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}We're close to Lewisburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.51,0:22:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}到了告诉我  提醒我一下\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Let me know when we get there. Remind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.22,0:22:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-我有几个地方要去  -好的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- I got some stops to make. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.19,0:22:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}罗素的生意无所不包\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Russell had a piece of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.74,0:22:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他在皮茨顿有家店叫佩恩布帘店\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He had this store in Pittston called Penn Drape & Curtains.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.50,0:22:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他在那里经营着一切生意\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And he ran everything out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.20,0:22:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}谁知道都有些什么\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Who knew what it all was?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他肯定有合伙人\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I mean, I'm sure the man had partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.87,0:22:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这种人总是有合伙人的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}They always have partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.66,0:22:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}没人能独占所有钱财\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Nobody keeps all the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.80,0:22:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}但人人都听罗素的  这点我能确定\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}But everybody listened to Russ. That I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.09,0:22:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你想贿赂一个法官  先问问罗素\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You wanted to bribe a judge, you asked Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你不知道该贿赂法官多少钱\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You didn't know how much to bribe him,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.68,0:22:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}罗素会告诉你\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Russell was gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.18,0:22:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}好  行  我马上就去\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}All right, all right. I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.72,0:22:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}来吧  交给我就行  别担心\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Come on. I'll take care of it. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.68,0:22:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你想提拔一个手下\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You want to promote one of your guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.36,0:23:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}罗素会告诉你行或不行\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Russ would tell you you could or you could not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.98,0:23:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}帮我个忙\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Do me a favor.
