Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.33,0:36:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-你知道是谁吗  -不\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- You know who? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.72,0:36:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}{\pos(192,245)\fs14\b1\bord1\shad0.5}也可以理解为"是我"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.72,0:36:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我知道\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.18,0:36:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-是谁  -不  是我\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- Who? - No. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.06,0:36:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}其他的股份是我的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I own the other part.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.54,0:36:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}而不是我认识持有剩余股份的人\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Not I know somebody who owns the other part.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.26,0:36:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}安吉洛  我不知道你有这家公司的股份\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Angelo, I didn't know you had any part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.04,0:36:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我要是知道的话\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I would never have done what I did
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.84,0:37:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}是绝对不会那么做的  我不知道\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}if I knew you were involved. I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.71,0:37:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我绝不会对你做这种事\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I would never, never do that against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.22,0:37:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}悄悄话没说老板是犹太黑帮吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Whispers didn't tell you it was Jew mob?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.92,0:37:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}没有  他说是犹太洗衣妇\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}No, he said Jew washerwomen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.92,0:37:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}犹太洗衣妇\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Jew washerwomen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.78,0:37:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他还说了什么\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}What else he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.85,0:37:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我猜他让你保密\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I bet he said keep it to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.00,0:37:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}别跟城里其他人透露一个字\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Don't say nothing to nobody Downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.34,0:37:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}的确\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.04,0:37:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我没核实\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I didn't check.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.80,0:37:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}对不起  我应该先核实一下的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I'm sorry. I should've checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.56,0:37:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-我能把钱退给他吗  -他用不着了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- Can I give him his money back? - He won't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.22,0:37:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你留着吧\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You can keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.69,0:37:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我不想惹麻烦\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I... I don't want no trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.87,0:37:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我把钱退给他吧  我没关系\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I'll just give it back to him and I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.13,0:37:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他用不着了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He won't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.83,0:37:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}好吧  谢谢\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.32,0:37:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}谢罗素吧\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Thank Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.24,0:37:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我本来不想浪费时间\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I wouldn't have wasted my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.30,0:37:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}打算让犹太黑帮找你算账\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I'd have let the Jew mob have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.29,0:37:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你这个朋友真没得说\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You got a good friend here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.42,0:38:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你不知道他多仗义\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You don't know how good a friend you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.36,0:38:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-我知道  -不  你不知道\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- I... I know. - No, you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.24,0:38:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}去吧台那等着吧\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Wait by the bar, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.37,0:38:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}像这种情况\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}In a case like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.85,0:38:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}最好的办法就是用全新的家伙\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}the best thing to do is you use something brand new.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.26,0:38:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}刚开箱的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Right out of the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.73,0:38:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}否则  你不知道它在哪里被用过\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Otherwise, you don't know where it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.78,0:38:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}或被谁用过\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You don't know who's used it,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.60,0:38:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}跟什么案子有关联\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}what crime it was connected to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.96,0:38:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}那无异于找死\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}That's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.62,0:38:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}所以我推荐用全新的  刚开箱的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}So I recommend something new, straight out of the... the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.72,0:38:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}冰冷  干净\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Stone cold. Clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.44,0:38:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你来了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.34,0:38:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我不知道你会从哪边过来\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I didn't know which way you were coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.35,0:38:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我不知道你从哪边...\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I didn't know which way you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.86,0:39:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}当然  下一步就是\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Naturally, the next thing you wanna do
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.33,0:39:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}把家伙扔掉  你得毁灭证据\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}is throw the thing away. You wanna get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.93,0:39:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}大家都扔在斯古吉尔河的一个地方\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}There's a spot in the Schuylkill River everybody uses.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.28,0:39:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}如果派人潜到河底\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}If they ever send divers down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.53,0:39:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}找到的武器够武装一个小国家了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}they'd be able to arm a small country.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.44,0:39:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}{\fs26\b1\bord2\shad0\i1\c&H202022&\3c&H8696AA&\fn方正艺黑简体\pos(242,86.933)}一男子在人行道上被枪杀
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.31,0:39:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}对我来说  杀死悄悄话后  一切都变了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}For me, everything changed after Whispers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.64,0:39:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这就像在军队\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It was like the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.44,0:39:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你服从命令\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You followed orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.11,0:39:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}听吩咐做事\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.17,0:39:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}就会得到相应的奖赏\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You got rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.24,0:40:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我替罗素做事\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And when I handled things for Russell,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.20,0:40:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}从来都不是为钱\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}it was never for money,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.65,0:40:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}而是为了表达尊重\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}but as a show of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.71,0:40:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你给他跑跑腿  帮帮忙\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}When you ran a little errand, you did a little favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.35,0:40:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}当你需要帮忙的时候  他也还你人情\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}you got a little favor back if you ever needed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.24,0:40:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你总是会需要帮忙的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And you always hurried back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.30,0:40:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-菲尔  你好啊  -你好\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- Phil, how you doing? - How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.08,0:40:19.90,music,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(300,300)\fs10\fn方正正准黑简体\bord1\shad0.5\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\4c&H000000&\b0\i1}♪ See the pyramids along the Nile ♪
