Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.39,0:52:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}不管是什么  水面就分开了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}whatever the fuck it was, and it opened up!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.76,0:52:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}就是他  相信我  吉米  他有那能力\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}That's him. I'm telling you. Jimmy, he's got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.91,0:53:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你觉得如何\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.89,0:53:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你还需要他在这待几天吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You need him a couple of days more?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.15,0:53:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}是的  我们还有一些零碎的事要处理\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Yeah, we gotta clear up a few dribs and drabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.11,0:53:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你们真喜欢西瓜啊\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You guys sure like watermelon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.34,0:53:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}想吃一口吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Want a bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.24,0:53:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}决不\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Not on your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.75,0:53:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你当时在场  你亲眼看到了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You were there. You saw it firsthand.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.05,0:53:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}那些人不是工会\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Those guys ain't union.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.29,0:53:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们就像是纳粹同谋  在战场后方行动\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}They're like Nazi collaborators, operating behind the lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.26,0:53:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-你懂的  你打过仗  -没错\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- You know. You were in the war. - I sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.53,0:53:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}在战争期间  你从一个地方转移到另一个地方\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}In a war, you go from point A to point B.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.11,0:53:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}有时候\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.92,0:53:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你会在路上洒一些啤酒\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}you spill a little beer along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.57,0:53:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你觉得这哲学有道理吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}That philosophy make sense to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.37,0:53:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}当然\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.46,0:53:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}很好\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.61,0:54:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}吉米  他不是因为喜欢我\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Jimmy, he didn't make me stay in his suite
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.55,0:54:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}而让我住他的套房\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}because he liked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.79,0:54:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他让我跟他一起住是因为他不想让我\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He made me stay with him because he didn't want me
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.80,0:54:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}用我的名字在酒店登记\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}registering in my name at the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.43,0:54:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这样  就没有证据证明我去过芝加哥\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}This way, there was no proof I was even in Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.15,0:54:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}加油  吉米  你落后好多\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Come on, Jimmy, you're way behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.90,0:54:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}什么都阻止不了她\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Nothing stops her.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.03,0:54:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}芝加哥那事之后  我和吉米走得更近了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}After Chicago, Jimmy and I got close.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.89,0:54:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}老婆们也相处得很融洽\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}The wives hit it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.61,0:54:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}因为吉米和约瑟芬的孩子\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And with Jimmy and Josephine's kids
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.31,0:54:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}大多已成年  离开了家\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}mostly grown up and out of the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.32,0:54:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们从我们孩子身上也获得不少乐趣\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}they got a kick out of our kids too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.10,0:54:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}吉米  佩琪  来拍张照\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Jimmy, Peggy, let's get a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.85,0:54:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}{\fn方正正中黑简体\fs20\b1\pos(135.6,209.6)}"约"·霍法
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.26,0:54:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}好  快来\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Oh. Yes. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.24,0:54:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}尤其是佩琪\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Especially Peggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.88,0:54:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}她和吉米  他们一下就喜欢上了对方\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}She and Jimmy, they fell for each other right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.41,0:54:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你知道比起拍照我更喜欢什么吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You know what I like even better than getting my picture took?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.25,0:54:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}什么\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.29,0:54:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}惊喜吧\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.47,0:54:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}佩琪\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Peggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.20,0:54:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}对佩琪来说  吉米不像罗素\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}To Peggy, Jimmy wasn't like Russ,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.44,0:54:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}不像瘦子也不像我\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}or Skinny or even me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.39,0:55:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}抱歉各位  这是买给我和佩琪的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Sorry, everybody. This is just for Peggy and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.67,0:55:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}一方面  吉米没有绰号\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}For one thing, Jimmy didn't have a nickname
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.87,0:55:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}比如"剃刀"或者"钟楼怪人"\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}like "The Razor," Or "The Hunchback,"
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.80,0:55:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}或者"黄鼠狼"亦或者"悄悄话"\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}or "The Weasel," Or "Whispers."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.41,0:55:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}怎么不说谢谢\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}So what happened to "Thank you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.46,0:55:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}谢谢\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.08,0:55:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}还有  对她来说  他是在帮助人\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And also, to her, he was helping people.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.68,0:55:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他在帮他们赚更多钱  过得更好\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He was helping them make more money, live better lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.89,0:55:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他没有踩别人的手\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He wasn't stomping on somebody's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.23,0:55:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}"如果你买东西  卡车会把东西送过去"\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}"'If you have it, a truck brought it to you."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.53,0:55:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这是霍法先生说的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}This is what Mr. Hoffa says.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.43,0:55:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他是卡车司机工会的主席\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He's the president of the Teamsters Union
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.61,0:55:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}成员超过一百万\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}with over a million members.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.86,0:55:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们都支持他因为他们有稳定的工作\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}They all support him because they have steady jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.61,0:55:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5\shad0.5\blur1\3c&HA47F6A&}{\fs18\b0\pos(208,211.733)\c&H171709&\fn方正新舒体简体}我是吉米·霍法的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.76,0:55:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}丰厚的薪水以及退休后的养老金\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}great pay and a pension for when they retire.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.10,0:55:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}卡车司机养老基金\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}The Teamster Pension Fund
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.55,0:55:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}有八十亿美元\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}had eight billion dollars in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.72,0:55:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}全部都由吉米控制\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And Jimmy had complete control over every bit of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.68,0:55:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这模型是不是很美\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Isn't this a beautiful presentation?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.45,0:55:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我只想要一笔过渡性贷款  吉米\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I mean, a bridge loan is really all I'm asking, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.28,0:55:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我不会把工会成员的养老金\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I'm not gonna piss away my members' pension dough
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.98,0:55:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}投资在风险过大的项目上\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}on something too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.21,0:55:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这没有风险  吉米\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}This is not a risk, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.11,0:56:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}《明斯基的荒唐事》这个节目是我的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I got Minsky's Follies.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.52,0:56:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}赌城大道第一个露乳舞女秀是我的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I got the first topless act on the Strip.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.88,0:56:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}相信我  我们在那的生意可好了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I'm telling you, we're booming in there.
