Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.45,1:22:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你愿意交代几个名字  免去牢狱之灾吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Would you be willing to give up names to keep from going to jail?
