Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.08,1:22:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}{\pos(192,245)\fs14\b0}美国参议院针对工人及管理层不当行为特别委员会
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.21,1:22:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}她第一时间退出了公司\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}she withdrew from the company immediately.
