Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.38,1:23:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}又不是我的错\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It wasn't my fault!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.09,1:23:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我也不知道\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.53,1:23:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我的查奇\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}My Chuckie!
