Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.06,1:23:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你们看见了吗  看见他的英勇之举了吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You see him? You see what he did?
