Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.37,1:24:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我和查奇都冲向了他  如果你们看见了的话\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I charged him and so did Chuckie, if you noticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.41,1:24:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我把他教得很好\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I taught him well.
