Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.68,1:24:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}跟我来\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Come with me.
