Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.08,1:28:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}是啊\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.58,1:28:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}金是最棒的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}That King's the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.66,1:28:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他是最棒的  他是个好人\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He's the best. He's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.05,1:28:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你看到他是怎样对付那个混蛋的吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You see him stand up to that jerk?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.59,1:28:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}看到了  看到了  我知道  他很棒\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Yeah, yeah, I know. He was great.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.55,1:28:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我就喜欢他这么干\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I love what he did.
