Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.59,1:28:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-我们需要更多他这样的人  -天啊\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- We need more like him. - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.81,1:28:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我们刚刚收到更多详细信息\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}More details just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.22,1:28:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这些详细信息是最新的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}These details are not the same as previously.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.93,1:28:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}肯尼迪总统在车队\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}President Kennedy, shot today,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.53,1:28:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}离开达拉斯市区时遇刺\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}just as his motorcade left downtown Dallas.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.32,1:28:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}肯尼迪夫人上前\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Mrs. Kennedy jumped up
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.53,1:28:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}抱住肯尼迪先生  大喊"不"\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and grabbed Mr. Kennedy. She called, "Oh, no!"
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.57,1:28:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}车队加速驶离\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}The motorcade sped on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.19,1:29:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}合众社报道称肯尼迪总统受的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}United Press says that the wounds of President Kennedy
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.37,1:29:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}可能是致命伤\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}perhaps could be fatal.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.33,1:29:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}正在重播哥伦比亚广播公司新闻发出的简报\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Repeating a bulletin from CBS News.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.37,1:29:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}肯尼迪总统在得克萨斯州的达拉斯市\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}President Kennedy has been shot
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.59,1:29:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}被一名嫌疑刺客开枪击中\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}by a would-be assassin in Dallas, Texas.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.92,1:29:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}请继续关注哥伦比亚广播公司新闻\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Stay tuned to CBS News for
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.02,1:29:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}了解更多详细信息\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}further details.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.50,1:29:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}什么\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.31,1:29:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}要做出一杯真正的咖啡\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It takes more than an instant
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.39,1:29:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}一瞬间可不够\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}to make a real cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.68,1:29:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}因此雀巢咖啡研制出了一种新产品\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}That's why Nescafé has come up with a new kind of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.52,1:29:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这不只是一种即溶咖啡  而是新的雀巢分钟煮咖啡\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It's more than an instant. It's new Minute Brew Nescafé.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.23,1:29:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}人人都能做出...\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Anybody can make a...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.32,1:29:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这显然是一则官方简报\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}The flash, apparently official,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.57,1:29:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}肯尼迪总统于中部标准时间下午一点\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}President Kennedy died at 1:00 p.m. Central standard time,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.24,1:29:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}东部标准时间下午两点去世\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}two o'clock, eastern standard time,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.08,1:29:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}大约38分钟前\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}some 38 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.71,1:29:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}副总统约翰逊已离开位于达拉斯的医院\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Vice President Johnson has left the hospital in Dallas,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.04,1:30:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}但我们不知道他将前往哪里\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}but we do not know, uh, to where he has proceeded.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.85,1:30:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}预计他很快将宣誓就职\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Presumably, he will be taking the oath of office shortly
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.64,1:30:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}成为第36届美国总统\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and become the 36th President of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.44,1:30:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad2\be1\3c&HA47F6A&\pos(192,45.867)}{\fs14\b1\fsp3\fn方正正中黑简体\c&H45596A&\3c&H8FA3A4&\4c&H000000&}国际卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.69,1:30:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}霍法先生  你会参加\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Mr. Hoffa, will you be attending
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.06,1:30:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}总统的葬礼吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}the President's funeral?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.74,1:30:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我没有受邀\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I wasn't invited.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.82,1:30:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}不一定要受邀  上百万的美国人都会参加\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You don't have to be invited. A million Americans will be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.66,1:30:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}那...\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.07,1:30:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我想我得查查我的日程\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I guess I'll have to check my schedule.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.82,1:30:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}如果你去参加并被请求发言  你会说什么\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}If you were to go and asked to speak, what would you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.75,1:30:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我会说\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I'd say, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.50,1:30:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}鲍比·肯尼迪现在只是个普通律师了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Bobby Kennedy is just another lawyer now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.42,1:30:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}混蛋\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.76,1:30:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad2\be1\3c&HA47F6A&\pos(192,45.867)}{\fs14\b1\fsp3\fn方正正中黑简体\c&H45596A&\3c&H8FA3A4&\4c&H000000&}国际卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.85,1:30:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}很好  埃里克  非常感谢\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Good, Eric. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.57,1:31:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}吉米说得对\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Jimmy was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.62,1:31:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}几乎是对的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Almost.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.37,1:31:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}鲍比的刁难到此为止了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}That was the end of it with Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.29,1:31:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他卸任司法部长了  事情了结了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}So much for him being the attorney general. That was done.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.68,1:31:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}鲍比跟我们的宿怨结束了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Bobby's vendetta was over, with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.52,1:31:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}霍法先生\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Mr. Hoffa,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.60,1:31:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你因损害了这个国家的灵魂\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}you stand here convicted of having tampered
