Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.99,1:44:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}那样动静就太大了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}'cause that makes too much noise,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.54,1:44:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}几个街区外的巡逻警车都能听到\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and a patrol car can hear it a few blocks away at least.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.31,1:44:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}警察管点32口径的叫女士枪  因为它比较好控制\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}The cops call a .32 a woman's gun because it's easier to handle
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.16,1:44:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}没有点38口径的破坏力\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and don't do the damage a .38 does,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.23,1:44:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}但是足够了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}but, you know, it does enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.18,1:45:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}到时候是深夜  爱达荷州的游客不会在那儿\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It would be late, so the tourists from Idaho
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.55,1:45:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们已经睡觉了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}wouldn't be there. They'd be in bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.64,1:45:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他在小意大利区\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And him being down there in Little Italy,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.86,1:45:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}也许会更自在  更放松\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}maybe he'd be more comfortable, more relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.14,1:45:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}那天是他生日  所以他会带着老婆孩子一起去\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It was his birthday so he'd be there with his wife
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.21,1:45:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这样正好\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and his kid which, in this case,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.61,1:45:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}因为这正是我们的目的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}that's good because that's the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.93,1:45:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}应该让他们亲眼见识\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}They should have to see what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.81,1:45:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他已经喝了不少酒\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He'd already been drinking,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.78,1:45:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这样他会迟缓很多\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}which would have slowed him down a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.97,1:45:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他的保镖会跟着他\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}His bodyguard would be with him
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.24,1:45:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}乔伊自己也应该是带着枪的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and Joey himself could be carrying, too,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.21,1:45:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}但他的枪可能在他老婆的包里\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}but then the piece would be in his wife's purse probably.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.63,1:45:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}从来不会事先对你透露多少\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You never got a lot of advance notice.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.99,1:45:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你只知道你到时候要做什么\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}All you knew was your part of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.16,1:45:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}红发约翰只知道\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}John the Redhead knew only one thing:
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.21,1:45:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他要开车送我过去\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}he was gonna drop me off,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.16,1:46:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}绕着街区转  然后再接我\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}circle the block and pick me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.32,1:46:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你得先解决掉保镖\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You wanna take out the bodyguard first.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.87,1:46:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}不是杀他  别杀他  让他失去行动能力就好\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Not kill him. Don't kill him, just disable him.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.44,1:46:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你跟他无冤无仇\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You got no argument with him,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.88,1:46:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}所以别照着脸或者胸膛来一枪\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}so, not in the face or the chest.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.97,1:46:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}有时  干这种活儿\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Sometimes, with something like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.71,1:46:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你可能想先去趟厕所\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}you might want to go to the bathroom first.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.86,1:46:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}好确定没人跟踪你进来\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It gives you a chance to make sure nobody followed you in.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.88,1:46:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}也能让你确定\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It also gives you a chance to make sure
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.29,1:46:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}无需担心厕所里的人\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}nobody is in the bathroom you have to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.49,1:46:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}也给你机会上趟厕所\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It also gives you a chance to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.81,1:46:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}干活的时候你不想不舒服\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You don't want to be uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.26,1:46:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}但我之前去过  深夜在这么个小餐厅\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}But I went before, and in a place this small, this late,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.58,1:46:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}直接干活就行了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}you might as well just get to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.71,1:46:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}再来点红酒\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}We need more wine, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.37,1:46:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}汤米  再来点红酒\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Tommy, some more wine.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.36,1:46:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}之后呢\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}So how about after?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.25,1:46:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-蛋糕  蛋糕  蛋糕  -现在还不行\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- Cake, cake, cake! - Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.50,1:46:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你还没吃完饭呢\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You're not even done eating the meal yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.88,1:46:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你要蛋糕  得了吧  不能这样\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You want the cake? Come on, you can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.48,1:47:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}靠\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.56,1:47:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}操  操\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Fuck! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.03,1:47:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}此事发生在纽约的小意大利区\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It happened in New York's Little Italy,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.05,1:47:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}传言这里是黑帮的中立地带\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}an area rumored to be neutral territory among mobsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.37,1:47:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}凶杀之后\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}After the killing,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.12,1:47:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}警方找到了几把枪以及一些指纹\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}police found several guns and some fingerprints
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.85,1:47:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}今日正在追查\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}which they were tracing today.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.75,1:47:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}"疯子乔"乔瑟夫·加洛\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Joseph "Crazy Joe" Gallo
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.14,1:47:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}晚间来到这家温馨的海鲜餐厅\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}had come to the intimate seafood restaurant to cap an evening of celebration
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.51,1:47:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}与他结婚不满一个月的妻子\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}with his new bride of less than a month,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.27,1:47:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}以及与前妻所生的十一岁女儿一起庆祝\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and his 11-year-old daughter by a previous marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.11,1:48:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们在庆祝乔的47岁生日\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}They were, uh, celebrating Joe's 47th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.15,1:48:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}那晚他们先去了一家夜店\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}They had been to a nightclub early in the evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.03,1:48:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们坐在餐厅后面的一桌  总共六个人\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}They were sitting at a rear table, this group of six people,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.73,1:48:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}然后\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}when a, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.87,1:48:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}一个男人从后门进来\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}a man walked in from the back door,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.42,1:48:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}直接走到\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and he walked up, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.92,1:48:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}走到桌子边上  开了三枪\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}to the side of the table. He fired three shots.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.31,1:48:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他打了乔两枪\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He hit Joe twice
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.99,1:48:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-还打了他的保镖  -佩琪  走吧\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- and he hit his bodyguard... - Peggy, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.99,1:48:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}希腊人皮特一枪\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}...Pete the Greek, one time.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.20,1:48:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}一共开了十四枪\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}There was a total of 14 shots fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.82,1:48:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}佩琪  走吧\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Peggy, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.46,1:48:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}乔伊·加洛的地盘总统街上\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It's quiet here on President Street,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.49,1:48:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}非常安静\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Joey Gallo's turf.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.69,1:48:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}甚至有些太安静了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}In fact, it's too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.70,1:48:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}在布鲁克林\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Out here in Brooklyn,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.81,1:48:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}乔伊·加洛是个英雄\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Joey Gallo was a hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.27,1:48:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}据猜测  他的死亡或将引发一场帮派战争\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Speculation has it that his death may start a gang war,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.05,1:48:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}可能已经悄然开始\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}if it hasn't already begun.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.03,1:49:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-你好好的  吉米  -你也是  麦奇\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- Take it easy, Jimmy. - You too, Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.33,1:49:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}保重了  吉米\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Take good care, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.94,1:49:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}以防再也不见  问个好\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}If I don't see you again, hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.36,1:49:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}四年后  花了五十万美元\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Four years later and $500,000 under the table
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.81,1:49:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}贿赂尼克松的连任委员会\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}to Nixon's re-election committee,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.78,1:49:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}吉米终于得偿所愿\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Jimmy finally got what he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.84,1:49:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}抱歉  不过我不会再回来了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Sorry, but I won't be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.43,1:49:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}总统特赦以及假释\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}A presidential pardon and his parole.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.54,1:49:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}吉米\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Jimmy!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.50,1:49:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你现在打算做什么  吉米\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}What are you gonna do now, Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.99,1:49:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我要做的第一件事就是\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Well, the first thing I'm gonna do is register
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.01,1:49:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}去联邦缓刑办公室登记\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}with the Federal Probation Office,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.80,1:49:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}然后就和我妻子一起去佛州晒太阳\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and then I'm going down to Florida with my wife to get some sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.13,1:49:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}那之后有什么计划吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Any plans after that?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.40,1:49:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我要夺回我工会的控制权\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Yeah, I'm gonna take back control of my union.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.15,1:49:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你要怎么做  吉米\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}How're you gonna do that, Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.16,1:49:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}菲茨也要竞选  你感觉怎么样\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}How do you like Fitz running against you?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.99,1:49:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}感觉不好\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.63,1:50:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}吉米  被关这么久是什么感觉\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Jimmy, what was it like being locked up all that time?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.89,1:50:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}非常好  我很开心\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It was wonderful. Had a great time.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.14,1:50:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我做的第一件事就是\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}The first thing I did was,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.35,1:50:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}去卢姆餐厅买了几个辣味热狗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I picked up some chili dogs from Lum's,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.33,1:50:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}吉米爱热狗就像爱冰激淋\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}which Jimmy loved almost as much as ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.72,1:50:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}理查德·尼克松总统\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}A consultant to President
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.04,1:50:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}连任竞选委员会的一名顾问\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Richard Nixon's re-election campaign committee...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.99,1:50:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们的秘诀就是用啤酒蒸香肠\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}The secret is they steam them in beer.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.31,1:50:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这是全美最好吃的热狗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}There ain't a better hot dog in America.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.41,1:50:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}警方称麦考德和他的同谋\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Police say McCord and his accomplices
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.57,1:50:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}随身带了电子监听设备\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}brought electronic listening devices with them
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.99,1:50:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}还卸下了两块天花板\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and had removed two ceiling panels...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.77,1:50:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}以便在民主党全国委员会\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}...while installing eavesdropping equipment
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.99,1:50:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}安装窃听设备\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}at the Democratic National Committee.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.73,1:50:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你看看  他还真有胆子竞选工会主席\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Look at this. He's got the balls to run for President of the Teamsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.76,1:50:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你看看  托尼·普罗还给他颁奖了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Look at this. And Tony Pro giving him an award.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.46,1:50:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这混蛋  你信吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}This fuck... Do you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.06,1:50:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}菲茨很受特定人群的欢迎\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Look, Fitz is very popular with certain people.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.00,1:50:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他当然受欢迎  能不受欢迎吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Of course he's popular. Who wouldn't be popular?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.84,1:50:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}哪个弟兄问他借钱他都给\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He loans money to every goombah who asks.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.55,1:50:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}所以托尼支持他  他把选票都给菲茨了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}That's why Tony's behind him. He's given Fitz all his votes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.70,1:50:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你受工会大多数人的支持\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You got great support from most of the union.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.91,1:50:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你只需要托尼·普罗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}All you need is Tony Pro's
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.36,1:50:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}在东北部的选民  你就能赢\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}voters in the Northeast, and you can win.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.21,1:50:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-你真不要吃一个吗  -不了  谢谢\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- You sure you don't want one of these? - No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.33,1:51:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我就是不敢相信我要去找托尼·普罗要选票\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I just can't believe I gotta go to Tony Pro to get votes.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.41,1:51:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这都什么跟什么\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.49,1:51:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}托尼牢牢控制着菲茨  吉米\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Tony has Fitz in his pocket, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.77,1:51:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}工会不受黑帮控制\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Wise guys don't run the union.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.33,1:51:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}有菲茨就行\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}With Fitz, they do.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.77,1:51:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}吉米  等你重新当上主席\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Jimmy, listen, as soon as you're back as president,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.24,1:51:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你想做什么就做什么\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}you can do anything you want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.36,1:51:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你想解雇谁就解雇谁\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You can fire anybody you want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.21,1:51:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你把托尼·普罗解雇了都行\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You can even fire Tony Pro.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.93,1:51:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你可以盯着他  让他清空桌子\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You could stand over him, watch him clear out his desk.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.57,1:51:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}还可以让他脱光  搜他的身\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You could strip-search the guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.17,1:51:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}确保他走的时候连个回形针都带不走\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Make sure he doesn't walk off with a paper clip.
