Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.22,2:00:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}那么菲茨对吉米的回应是怎样的呢\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}So what's Fitz's answer to Jimmy?
