Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.90,2:09:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}然后就开始上牛排了  我的是一分熟\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Well, they bring out the steaks. Mine's rare.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.44,2:09:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}弗兰克的那份正从厨房里走出来\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Frank's was still walking from the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.41,2:09:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他转身对我说  "其实吧\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He turns to me, he said, "Well, you know,
