Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.50,2:09:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他居然喜欢动物\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He's an animal lover.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.94,2:09:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这家伙连主席都没当上\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}This guy is not even the goddamn president
