Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.22,2:15:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我人生最重要的时刻  非常非常感谢你\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It's the highlight of my life. Thank you very, very much.
