Dialogue: 0,2:57:04.65,2:57:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}可以肯定的是\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And one thing for sure,
Dialogue: 0,2:57:07.40,2:57:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他去那里不是为了吃午餐的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}he didn't go there for fucking lunch.
