Dialogue: 0,2:57:38.69,2:57:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}后来才知道萨利确实跟别人说了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Turns out Sally did tell somebody
