Dialogue: 0,2:57:42.27,2:57:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}只不过对方忘了告诉别人\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}They just forgot to tell somebody else.
