Dialogue: 0,2:57:48.99,2:57:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}吉米的儿子查奇  他的养子\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Jimmy's son, Chuckie, you know, his foster son,
Dialogue: 0,2:57:51.20,2:57:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}也参与了这件事\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}was in the thing, too,
Dialogue: 0,2:57:52.70,2:57:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}但他并不知情\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}but he didn't know it.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:55.16,2:57:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}查奇只知道他要接\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}All Chuckie knew was he was pickin' up
Dialogue: 0,2:57:57.28,2:57:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我和一个普罗的人\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}one of Pro's guys and me,
Dialogue: 0,2:57:59.04,2:58:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}然后我们要一起到红狐餐厅\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and we was all gonna pick up his dad
Dialogue: 0,2:58:01.17,2:58:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}接他爸去开会\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}at the Red Fox for a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:03.79,2:58:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他参与了这件事  没错\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Well, I mean, he was in it, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,2:58:05.25,2:58:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}可以这么说  但他是糊里糊涂的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}you could say that, but stupidly.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:08.25,2:58:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我一直对查奇心怀愧疚\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I... I always felt sorry for Chuckie in this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:11.09,2:58:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我现在仍然很愧疚\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And I... I still do.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:12.89,2:58:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}联调局因为一台车的破事\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And the Feds gave him ten months
Dialogue: 0,2:58:14.55,2:58:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}让他被判刑十个月  事情大概就是这样\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}for some bullshit thing about a car, and that's about it.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:17.22,2:58:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}谁知道是在搞什么\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Who knows what the fuck...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:20.60,2:58:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}胖子托尼·萨雷诺因为所得税的事情被抓\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Fat Tony Salerno, they got on an income tax thing.
