Dialogue: 0,2:58:37.41,2:58:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}猪肉店\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}northern California.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:40.67,2:58:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}就在\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Right around...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:43.12,2:58:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}核桃溪市边上\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Walnut Creek.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:44.04,2:58:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你是从那里来的  对吧\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You're from up there, ain't you?
Dialogue: 0,2:58:46.00,2:58:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-对  -嗯\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:47.54,2:58:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你可能还认识店主\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And you might even know the guy that runs it.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:50.38,2:58:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}其实  我想让你帮个忙\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Actually, I'm looking for a little favor...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:53.05,2:58:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}帮他  不是帮我\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}for him, not for me.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:55.84,2:58:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你能不能帮他弄张机票  比如去澳大利亚的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}But if you can get him a ticket, like, to Australia...
Dialogue: 0,2:59:01.14,2:59:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你懂我的意思\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:04.98,2:59:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}好\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:07.56,2:59:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你愿意帮他出国吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You want to help him get down there?
Dialogue: 0,2:59:15.15,2:59:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}愿意\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Ye... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:16.36,2:59:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}罗素被抓了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Now, Russell, he got pinched
Dialogue: 0,2:59:18.15,2:59:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}因为杰克·拿波里从他那赊账\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}for telling Jimmy the Weasel to strangle Jack Napoli
Dialogue: 0,2:59:20.79,2:59:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}拿走了价值两万五的珠宝却没还钱\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}over some beef about 25 grand of jewelry
Dialogue: 0,2:59:23.58,2:59:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}于是他让黄鼠狼吉米\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}that Jack took on credit from Russell
Dialogue: 0,2:59:26.12,2:59:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}去把杰克勒死\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and then he never paid for.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:28.29,2:59:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你不能对罗素做这样的事\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Now, with Russ, you don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:31.72,2:59:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}问题在于  黄鼠狼叛变了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}So, only thing is, the Weasel, he flipped.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:35.01,2:59:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他身上带了窃听器\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He had a wire on him.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:36.88,2:59:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们声称他"密谋杀害目击者"\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}They called it "conspiracy to kill a witness."
Dialogue: 0,2:59:39.52,2:59:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}显而易见的是\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It was obvious to everybody else
Dialogue: 0,2:59:40.81,2:59:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}拿波里做得不对\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}that Napoli was clearly in the wrong.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:42.64,2:59:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这难道不明显吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I mean, how could you not see that?
Dialogue: 0,2:59:44.85,2:59:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他陷害了他  这是诱捕\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He set him up. It was entrapment.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:46.73,2:59:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}难道不是吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}What else could you call it?
Dialogue: 0,2:59:48.31,2:59:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}但这件事我现在也不想细说\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}But that's another thing I don't wanna get into now.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:52.61,2:59:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}举起右手\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Raise your right hand.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:53.40,2:59:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们把我送上法庭  指控我行贿和工会诈骗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}They brought me up on bribery and labor racketeering charges
Dialogue: 0,2:59:56.78,2:59:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}还有其他一些我不知道的破事\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and some other bullshit things I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:58.57,3:00:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad1\be1\pos(268.5,178)}{\fs14\b0\fn方正正中黑简体\3c&H292A27&\4c&H000000&}谋杀
