Dialogue: 0,2:59:58.57,3:00:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad1\be1\pos(269.2,212)}{\fs14\b0\fn方正正中黑简体\3c&H292A27&\4c&H000000&}恐吓
