Dialogue: 0,2:59:59.25,3:00:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你是否向上帝发誓  你所说的全是事实\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}the whole truth and nothing but the truth,
Dialogue: 0,3:00:01.08,3:00:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-没有任何隐瞒  -我发誓\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- so help you God? - I do.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:02.66,3:00:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你是否还告诉他们巴法先生\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Did you also tell them that Mr. Boffa
Dialogue: 0,3:00:04.79,3:00:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}送了你和你妻子豪车\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}had given you and your wife luxury vehicles?
Dialogue: 0,3:00:06.91,3:00:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}科尔先生  我工作了44年\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Mr. Cole, I worked for 44 years,
Dialogue: 0,3:00:10.17,3:00:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我没收过巴法或者别人的任何不法之财\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I never took one dime illegal off Boffa or nobody else.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:14.63,3:00:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你怎么想是你的事  跟我没关系\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You can think whatever you wanna think. Don't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:17.09,3:00:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}但他们能落实的罪名  只有我炸了一家吊车公司\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}But all they got me for was blowing up a crane company
Dialogue: 0,3:00:20.18,3:00:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}那家公司开除了我的两个工会谈判代表\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}that fired two of my shop stewards
Dialogue: 0,3:00:22.27,3:00:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}却没有正当的理由\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}for no good reason.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:25.93,3:00:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}还有我的林肯汽车\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And... And my Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:28.39,3:00:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我从尤金·巴法手里买下来的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I mean, I bought that car from Eugene Boffa.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:31.90,3:00:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他向货运公司出租卡车司机\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He leased truck drivers to freight companies,
Dialogue: 0,3:00:34.48,3:00:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}然后付给他们低于正常标准的工资\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and then he paid them substandard wages.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:39.29,3:00:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们说我买这辆车花的钱\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}They said I paid a lot less for the car
Dialogue: 0,3:00:41.54,3:00:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}远低于其价值\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}than what it was worth.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:43.62,3:00:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他们说这辆车是贿赂\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}They said the car was a bribe.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:51.75,3:00:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我爱这辆车\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I... I... I loved that car.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:54.42,3:00:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}但它不值得我为它坐十八年牢\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}But it wasn't worth the 18 years they gave me for it.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:58.42,3:00:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这是肯定的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:04.35,3:01:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}罗素中风了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Russell, he had a stroke.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:06.76,3:01:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}胖托尼尿失禁了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Fat Tony, he couldn't control his urine no more.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:10.36,3:01:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我在安齐奥的散兵坑里得上的关节炎\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And my arthritis that started in the foxholes of Anzio
Dialogue: 0,3:01:14.98,3:01:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}不断折磨着我的腰\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}was eatin' away at my lower back now,
Dialogue: 0,3:01:17.61,3:01:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我的脚已经没什么知觉了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and I couldn't feel much in my feet no more.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:20.66,3:01:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我需要拄拐杖\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I needed a cane.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:21.78,3:01:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}但他们不会在牢里给你配拐杖\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}But, you know, they're not gonna give you a cane in the can
Dialogue: 0,3:01:24.74,3:01:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}因为他们怕你把它当作武器\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}because they say you're gonna use it as a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:27.66,3:01:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}有一种叫诺立汀的药\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}There was this medicine, Neurontin,
Dialogue: 0,3:01:29.42,3:01:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}对我有点帮助\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}it helped me a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,3:01:30.59,3:01:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}但也会使你神经错乱\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}but it also made you loopy.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:32.71,3:01:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他要打中了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He's got it!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:34.29,3:01:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他要打中了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}He's got it!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:36.88,3:01:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我们在严寒中\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}We were all falling apart right there
Dialogue: 0,3:01:38.21,3:01:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}都要崩溃了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}in the freezing fucking cold.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:39.89,3:01:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我在这里就能看到  你现在怕了吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I can see it from here. You getting scared now?
Dialogue: 0,3:01:41.76,3:01:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}你再练个十年\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Yeah, you stay here another fucking ten years,
Dialogue: 0,3:01:43.68,3:01:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}才有可能赢我\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}you'll beat me.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:54.02,3:01:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}这是好喝的葡萄汁吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Is this the good grape juice?
Dialogue: 0,3:02:08.67,3:02:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我吃不了这个\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I can't eat it.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:10.54,3:02:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-吃一口  -我没牙  吃不了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- Take a bite. - I got no teeth. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:12.25,3:02:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}给我一小块\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Put a little piece.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:14.04,3:02:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}一小块就好  谢谢\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Just a little piece, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:15.46,3:02:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}还要吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,3:02:30.02,3:02:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-好吃吧  -好吃\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- E buono, no? - Buono.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:32.35,3:02:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}好吃\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Buono.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:38.15,3:02:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}吉米是个好人\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Jimmy was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:40.36,3:02:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他还有美满的家庭  不是吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You know? He had a nice family too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,3:02:45.74,3:02:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}是的  我知道\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Yeah. Yeah. I know.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:49.21,3:02:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我从没想过要把事情做这么绝\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I never wanted it to go that far.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:00.84,3:03:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我为了我们的利益而放弃了他\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I picked us over him.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:04.51,3:03:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}去他们的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Fuck 'em.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:06.72,3:03:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}去他们的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Fuck 'em.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:09.73,3:03:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}去他们的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Fuck 'em.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:16.69,3:03:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}吃吧  小子  吃吧\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Mangia che cresci... figlio mio, mangia.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:35.54,3:03:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}罗素\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Hey, Russ.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:36.83,3:03:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}弗兰克\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Hey, Frankie.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:38.12,3:03:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-你要去哪  -什么\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- Where you goin'? - What?
Dialogue: 0,3:03:39.97,3:03:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-你要去哪  -我要去教堂\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- Where you goin'? - I'm going to church.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:43.01,3:03:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}教堂\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Church?
Dialogue: 0,3:03:44.42,3:03:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}别笑  到时你就知道了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Don't laugh, you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:46.13,3:03:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}别笑\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Don't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:47.84,3:03:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}到时你就知道了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:56.93,3:03:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}罗素去了教堂\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Russell went to church.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:00.86,3:04:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}后来他去了监狱的医院\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Then he went to the prison hospital.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:06.28,3:04:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}再后来他进了坟墓\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And... And then he went to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:12.45,3:04:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}主耶稣基督\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Lord Jesus Christ...
Dialogue: 0,3:04:15.58,3:04:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我在那年的十月出狱了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I got out that October.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:17.50,3:04:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}琳妮在十二月去世了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Reenie died in December.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:19.96,3:04:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}准确地说是12月23日\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}On December 23rd, to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:23.09,3:04:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}肺癌\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Lung cancer.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:24.76,3:04:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}一点也不意外\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}No surprise.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:26.92,3:04:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}即使夺去了我们必死的身躯\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}...even as it claims our mortal bodies.
