Dialogue: 0,3:08:15.15,3:08:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我知道我不是个好父亲  我知道\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I know I wasn't a... a good dad. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:18.28,3:08:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我知道  我只是想保护她\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I know that. I was just trying to protect her.
