Dialogue: 0,3:17:38.21,3:17:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}今天很不错\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It's great today.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:40.10,3:17:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我还活着\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I'm still alive?
Dialogue: 0,3:17:41.31,3:17:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-是的  -真是好消息\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- Yes, you are. - That's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:44.14,3:17:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}活得好好的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:45.56,3:17:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}现在没事了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And you're free
Dialogue: 0,3:17:47.01,3:17:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}不过晚些时候还要再给你检查一遍\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}till later today when we have to put you through all this again.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:49.52,3:17:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我哪都不去\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:09.67,3:18:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}...教会之奉\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}...ministry of the church.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:11.29,3:18:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}愿上帝赐予你宽恕与平静  弗兰克\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}May God grant you pardon and peace, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:14.34,3:18:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我赦免你的罪\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}And I absolve you from your sins.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:15.54,3:18:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}以圣父  圣子\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}In the name of the Father, and of the Son,
Dialogue: 0,3:18:18.04,3:18:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}圣灵的名义  阿门\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}and of the Holy Spirit, amen.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:21.22,3:18:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}感谢上帝  因为上帝仁慈\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Give thanks to the Lord, for he is good.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:24.05,3:18:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}他的慈爱\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}His mercy...
Dialogue: 0,3:18:25.14,3:18:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-他的慈爱永远长存  -永远长存\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- His mercy endures forever. - endures forever.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:27.76,3:18:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}好了  弗兰克  我很快就会再来看你\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}All right, Frank. I'll be back to visit, okay? Very soon.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:30.77,3:18:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}大概圣诞假期后\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Probably after the Christmas holidays.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:34.19,3:18:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}好的\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:35.11,3:18:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-弗兰克  上帝保佑你  -你也是  谢谢\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- Frank, God bless you. - You too. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:40.16,3:18:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}圣诞节到了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}It's Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,3:18:42.41,3:18:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}快了\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Almost.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:44.49,3:18:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}我哪也不去\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Well, I ain't going nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:48.83,3:18:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}-神父  -怎么\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}- Father? - Yup?
Dialogue: 0,3:18:51.50,3:18:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}帮我个忙好吗\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,3:18:53.29,3:18:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0.5\be1}别把门关严  我不喜欢那样\N{\fn文泉驿微米黑\fs12\be1\3c&H000000&\c&H169AF7&\bord1\shad0.5\4c&H000000&}Don't shut the door all the way. I don't like that. Just...
